# Bundled example data

This folder contains small, ready-to-run example inputs for HSV-1:

- `example_fasta.fasta` for FASTA profiling
- `example_vcf.vcf` for VCF profiling
- `vcf_reference.fasta` as the required reference for the VCF example

## Before you run the examples

First download and build a maintained, HerpesDRG-compatible ResPro project database.
Use the maintained database flow and download:

```bash
respro databases --list
respro databases --download herpesdrg --output data/project_databases/
```

After download, use the generated `.db` file path as `--project` in the commands below.

## Run the bundled FASTA example

```bash
respro fasta \
    --project data/project_databases/<downloaded_project>.db \
    --fasta example_data/example_fasta.fasta \
    --output output/example_fasta
```

## Run the bundled VCF example

```bash
respro vcf \
    --project data/project_databases/<downloaded_project>.db \
    --vcf example_data/example_vcf.vcf \
    --ref-fasta example_data/vcf_reference.fasta \
    --output output/example_vcf \
    --export json \
    --export pdf
```

The HTML report, pdf summary and a json are written into the selected output folder.
